{"kind":"table","sheet":"Questions","address":"A1:N6","rows":6,"cols":14,"values":[["Question English","Question Hindi","A English","A Hindi","B English","B Hindi","C English","C Hindi","D English","D Hindi","Correct Answer","Explanation","Paper","Unit"],["What is 20% of 150?","150 का 20% कितना है?","20","20","25","25","30","30","35","35","C","English: 150 × 20 ÷ 100 = 30.\nहिंदी: 150 × 20 ÷ 100 = 30।","Paper 1","General"],["What is the average of 4, 6 and 8?","4, 6 और 8 का औसत कितना है?","4","4","6","6","8","8","18","18","B","English: Average = (4 + 6 + 8) ÷ 3 = 6.\nहिंदी: औसत = (4 + 6 + 8) ÷ 3 = 6।","Paper 1","General"],["Find the next number: 2, 4, 8, 16, ...","अगली संख्या ज्ञात कीजिए: 2, 4, 8, 16, ...","18","18","24","24","30","30","32","32","D","English: Each number is twice the previous number. 16 × 2 = 32.\nहिंदी: प्रत्येक संख्या पिछली संख्या की दोगुनी है। 16 × 2 = 32।","Paper 1","General"],["A class has 12 boys and 18 girls. What is the simplest ratio of boys to girls?","एक कक्षा में 12 लड़के और 18 लड़कियाँ हैं। लड़कों और लड़कियों का सरलतम अनुपात क्या है?","2:3","2:3","3:2","3:2","1:3","1:3","2:5","2:5","A","English: Divide both parts of 12:18 by 6 to get 2:3.\nहिंदी: 12:18 के दोनों पदों को 6 से भाग देने पर 2:3 मिलता है।","Paper 1","General"],["Which fraction is equal to 0.25?","कौन-सी भिन्न 0.25 के बराबर है?","1/2","1/2","1/4","1/4","3/4","3/4","1/5","1/5","B","English: 0.25 = 25/100 = 1/4.\nहिंदी: 0.25 = 25/100 = 1/4।","Paper 1","General"]]}
